{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/logo_tr.png?t=1745539016\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dive into interstellar war</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Galactic Outlaws, you\u2019re part of an elite squadron tasked with impossible missions: sabotage, high-stakes rescues, and battles against enemy fleets. Choose your ship, customize its loadout, and face dynamic challenges across diverse scenarios\u2014from enemy-infested asteroids to burning space stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2b50 <strong>Unique, deeply customizable ships</strong>: Unlock and upgrade a fleet of ships, each with distinct weapons and attributes (speed, shields, firepower). Mix modules to suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/ezgif-5c711e47aa59cb.gif?t=1745539016\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2b50 <strong>Devastating weapons</strong>: Precision lasers, homing missiles, plasma cannons\u2014experiment to find your perfect combo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/ezgif-5da057cfc599c1.gif?t=1745539016\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2b50 <strong>Varied environments</strong>: Fight across war-torn planets, asteroid belts, and enemy capital ships, each with unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/ezgif-5117f01c3b82e9.gif?t=1745539016\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2b50 <strong>Progression system</strong>: Upgrade your hangar, unlock special abilities, and dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/ezgif-54573236ef4906.gif?t=1745539016\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2b50 <strong>Memorable enemies &amp; bosses</strong>: Face rival factions with adaptive AI and epic bosses that will test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/ezgif-544c1c12a25cb4.gif?t=1745539016\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Do you have what it takes to survive this galactic war?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661630?t=1745539016","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661630?t=1745539016","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/61be3a62ebc9098c4e7109c6a939a4e657bb61f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745539016","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/61be3a62ebc9098c4e7109c6a939a4e657bb61f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745539016","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/logo_tr.png?